# Shell scripts keep LF line endings in every checkout, Windows included
# (core.autocrlf=true would give them CRLF): the Docker image copies
# deploy/entrypoint.sh from the checkout, and with CRLF its first line asks
# for "/bin/sh\r", so the container stops at once with
# "exec /entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory".
*.sh text eol=lf
